# sreteniya runtime

reference runtime for the SUTI semantic operating system.

---

## ∴ purpose

SRETENIYA Runtime is the reference execution environment
for the SUTIcore specifications.

it transforms semantic structure into operational behavior.

its function is not to define meaning,
but to execute semantic architecture consistently.

it does not accumulate information.

it reduces ambiguity,
stabilizes orientation,
and supports deliberate action.

---

