## ⚙ deployment

reference installation:

```bash
#!/usr/bin/env bash

set -e

INSTALL_PATH="${HOME}/sreteniya-runtime"

mkdir -p "${INSTALL_PATH}"/{
runtime,
vault,
kernel,
logs,
config
}

cat > "${INSTALL_PATH}/runtime.conf" << EOF
runtime=sreteniya
version=2026.05
status=active
EOF

echo "runtime initialized"
```

production deployments
may provide alternative implementations.

